## Graphical Abstract
## Efficient $c_{2}H_{4}$ purification in M-PNMI (M=Mn, Zn, Cd)
## Highlights
M-PNMI MOFs with rich accessible ethane binding sites as efficient ethane absorbents.   
DPNI linkers were utilized to construct a favorable environment for ethane binding.   
Both high uptake ratio and low adsorption heat were realized on these MOFs.   
M-PNMI exhibits excellent separation ability for removal of low concentration ethane.
